        "id": "EX-CORE-U6-01-skill-K-HSK6-speak-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "HSK 6: speak",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Restate each viewpoint fairly before giving your position. A supported position can remain tentative; distinguish evidence, inference and personal judgement.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "互助",
                "pinyin": "hùzhù",
                "meaning": "to help each other",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "2ee30e6bfbeb52df3543eee30b3ce144f46349f5135ea2c28895a2704ccfef6e"
              },
              {
                "text": "人家",
                "pinyin": "rénjia",
                "meaning": "other people; somebody else; I/me in context-dependent conversational self-reference",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "5e531b2f4ab58d3e64aca5be8a215736421c3d355f0c23266ee96f338f9d1901"
              },
              {
                "text": "可能",
                "pinyin": "kěnéng",
                "meaning": "might; possible",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "64e53487039dd8101be9ee0d489e64544cd5b06f7f1b9e6255cca2a09f76149c"
              },
              {
                "text": "根据",
                "pinyin": "gēnjù",
                "meaning": "according to; based on",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "ec053664fca52c2c4461a08b7b292da1646f3bd8f336e29886899f007f1f0958"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A says mutual help is important and takes an unanswered request as unwillingness to help. B also values mutual help but says the recipient may not have understood the request. The only confirmed fact is that no reply has arrived; neither intention nor understanding is established. Present both viewpoints and a qualified position.\nFamiliar meanings available: to help each other; other people; somebody else; I/me in context-dependent conversational self-reference; might; possible; according to; based on."
          }
        ]
      },
